<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss SPG plans bourse listing.</title>
<headline>Swiss SPG plans bourse listing.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sustainable Asset Management AG (SAM) said an investment company called Sustainable Performacne Group (SPG) it has formed with Swiss Re and the Volkart Group would seek a Swiss bourse listing in August.</p>
<p>SPG will invest in companies that display an above-average yield/risk profile on the basis of their competitive position, management quality, financial strength and long-term business starategy, SAM said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said it would provide more details at a news conference in Zurich on June 17.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
